This repository is a fork that adds a Linux port. Files changed for the port
are listed in the git history of the `linux-port` branch; the main changes are:
- CMakeLists.txt / CMakePresets.json: portable core split from the Windows
  targets, Linux presets, DirectXMath fetched for non-Windows builds.
- POSIX code paths in src/tools/orientation_calibrate.cpp and the selftests.
- New: docs/linux/, packaging/linux/, scripts/linux/, third_party/sal/,
  and the Linux platform code under src/platform/linux/ and src/app_linux/.

Third-party components fetched or used at build time:
- DirectXMath (MIT License), https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXMath
- hidapi (BSD/GPLv3/original HIDAPI license, distribution package)
- nlohmann/json (MIT License, distribution package)
